    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches Estate Agents are delighted to present this substantial freehold mixed-use investment opportunity to the market, comprising commercial and residential properties in the heart of Clonee Village, Dublin 15.\r\n\r\nThis unique offering provides an investor with the opportunity to acquire a combination of commercial and residential assets within an established and highly accessible Dublin 15 location.\r\n\r\nThe overall opportunity comprises a prominent two-storey detached commercial building with excellent main street frontage together with a separate block of four spacious two-bedroom apartments.\r\n\r\nThe commercial element currently produces a rental income of approximately €100,000 per annum, with tenants not affected, while the four residential apartments are currently vacant providing flexibility for a purchaser to establish their preferred letting strategy.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe residential element comprises a block of four spacious two-bedroom apartments ideally positioned just off the main street in Clonee Village.\r\n\r\nThe development comprises two apartments at ground-floor level and two apartments at first-floor level with each apartment benefiting from its own private door entrance, surface parking and use of a communal garden.\r\n\r\nThe apartments are similarly laid out and provide well-proportioned accommodation throughout. Each apartment comprises a generous living room, separate fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, two bedrooms with built-in wardrobes and a main bathroom with three-piece suite and tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nA spacious entrance hallway incorporating useful storage completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nThe two first-floor apartments enjoy pleasant views over the adjoining green Pitch & Putt course adding to the appeal of the residential accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, there is six off-street surface parking bays to the front of the apartment block while all apartments benefit from electric storage heating.\r\nImportantly, all four apartments are currently vacant, providing a purchaser with flexibility regarding future occupation and letting arrangements."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tFreehold block comprising four apartments\r\n•\tFour spacious two-bedroom apartments\r\n•\tTwo ground-floor and two first-floor apartments\r\n•\tUse of communal garden \r\n•\tAll four apartments currently vacant\r\n•\tEach apartment benefits from its own private own-door entrance\r\n•\tGenerous living accommodation\r\n•\tSeparate fitted kitchens with integrated appliances\r\n•\tBuilt-in bedroom wardrobes\r\n•\tThree-piece bathroom suites\r\n•\tSix off-street parking bays \r\n•\tFirst-floor apartments overlooking Pitch & Putt course\r\n•\tElectric storage heating"
      }
    ],
